  "notes": "Released under the name Gemma; Gemma 1.1 (google.gemma-1-1) followed on 2024-04-05 according to the Gemma releases page. Google says Gemma is built from the same research and technology as Gemini, without naming a source model, so no derived-from relation. The model cards describe text-to-text, English-language models under the Gemma terms of use, which permit responsible commercial use. The bare name Gemma is the family name, so it is never matched."
